---
source: crates/holst-mcp/src/setup/connect/tests.rs
expression: shown
---
Other clients: add the server by hand.

Hermes, in ~/.hermes/config.yaml:
mcp_servers:
  holst-rs:
    command: "/opt/holst/holst-mcp"

opencode, in opencode.json:
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "mcp": {
    "holst-rs": {
      "command": [
        "/opt/holst/holst-mcp"
      ],
      "enabled": true,
      "type": "local"
    }
  }
}

Any client that takes an mcpServers entry:
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "holst-rs": {
      "command": "/opt/holst/holst-mcp"
    }
  }
}
